From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:01:43 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(ui): route holes page family through the form seam

Routes holes_page.rs and thread_page.rs through the form seam helpers
in layout/controls.rs and fields.rs, eliminating all 15 raw ui calls in
the holes family. Adds form_seam_tests.rs to guard the holes family at
zero raw calls and verify control labels, clicks, and accessible names.

Refs #1122
